# GarageGuru SDLC

- Tickets: Jira project GG — https://anka.atlassian.net/jira/software/projects/GG
- Branch: `feature/GG-n-short-name`
- Commit and PR title must include `GG-n`
- Open a pull request. Do not push to main. Do not deploy production.
- This checkout is one codebase. Do not implement other teams' apps here.
